Cell["\<\
Shape elements:

someValidSymbol - a named dimension, possibly bound to an integer value; \
otherwise inferred
someInteger - an explicit immediate
ellipsis -  a sequence of some omitted dimensions
namedEllipsis -  a sequence of some dimension pattern
bracket - what can be bracketed?
product - an ordered product dimension, row major
sum - an ordered direct sum dimension\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9914568299189987`*^9, 3.991456832859272*^9}, {
