Cell["\<\
We should have the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]graph\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
feature of einx, i.e., just spit a Held or Deferred expression.
Which reminds me that the bindings that EinstoffShapes return should also \
have the keys held;
this also mitigates hygiene problems, even without the measures we employed.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9922215010350647`*^9, 3.9922215460784397`*^9}, {
  3.9922223072887993`*^9, 
  3.9922223544570007`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"72983120-5845-134d-aea9-\
61a7c6bd5137"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
